# Cloudflare Workers static assets / Pages. Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer.
# Tiles served from another origin (R2) will need Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
# (or CORS) on that bucket as well.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
